96
00:08:56.335 --> 00:08:58.453
 She was like a sister to me.

97
00:09:00.306 --> 00:09:04.008
 For her sake.
 I'll help get you home.

98
00:09:07.798 --> 00:09:10.064
              King's Landing is
              my home now.

99
00:09:12.085 --> 00:09:13.685
 Look around you.

100
