137
00:11:31.724 --> 00:11:33.141
 I'm afraid of him.

138
00:11:33.209 --> 00:11:34.608
             Oh. you should be.

139
00:11:36.079 --> 00:11:37.879
          He's a dangerous man.

140
00:11:39.115 --> 00:11:41.982
              But everyone has
              their weaknesses.

141
00:11:42.051 --> 00:11:44.852
          Your current employer
