150
00:12:12.982 --> 00:12:14.649
 One or two tried.

151
00:12:14.735 --> 00:12:16.301
                      Ah.

152
00:12:16.369 --> 00:12:18.269
          But you fought
          them off.

153
00:12:18.338 --> 00:12:20.271
    But maybe
    you wished
    one of them could

154
00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:24.175
         overpower you.
         fling you down.
         tear off your clothes.

155
00:12:24.244 --> 00:12:26.244
            But none of them
            were strong enough.

156
00:12:26.313 --> 00:12:27.512
             I'm strong enough.

157
00:12:27.581 --> 00:12:28.713
 Not interested.

158
00:12:28.781 --> 00:12:30.698
