160
00:12:35.922 --> 00:12:37.154
   JAIME: Ah.

161
00:12:37.223 --> 00:12:39.257
 "They lay with lions."

162
00:12:39.325 --> 00:12:41.192
 Tavern girls. I'd say.

163
00:12:41.261 --> 00:12:44.162
 Probably served
 my father's soldiers.

164
00:12:44.231 --> 00:12:47.598
 Maybe one of them gave
