165
00:12:47.667 --> 00:12:50.268
 That's how they earned this.

166
00:12:50.336 --> 00:12:53.821
 The glorious work
 of the Northern
 freedom fighters.

167
00:12:53.889 --> 00:12:55.956
 Must make you proud
 to serve the Starks.

168
00:12:56.025 --> 00:12:58.326
      I don't serve the Starks.

169
00:12:58.394 --> 00:13:00.261
          I serve Lady Catelyn.

170
00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:03.698
 Tell yourself that tonight
