171
00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:08.619
            What are you doing?

172
00:13:08.688 --> 00:13:09.954
          Burying them.

173
00:13:10.023 --> 00:13:13.774
        We shouldn't stay here.
        We should get
        back on the river.

174
00:13:13.843 --> 00:13:15.310
