175
00:13:15.378 --> 00:13:17.278
      I don't care
      what you think.

176
00:13:17.347 --> 00:13:19.280
  MAN: I didn't leave it here.
  I had me dagger.

177
00:13:19.349 --> 00:13:20.548
                 Untie me. Now!

178
00:13:20.617 --> 00:13:22.033
      MAN: I gave it to
      you to cut the rope.

179
00:13:22.101 --> 00:13:23.467
    and now I don't
    have me dagger no more.

180
00:13:23.536 --> 00:13:26.104
    So unless it got
    stuck in your arse
    on its way to your cunt.

181
00:13:26.173 --> 00:13:29.007
      it stands to reason
      that it's gone. Whoa.

182
00:13:30.743 --> 00:13:32.109
     What's your business here?

183
00:13:32.912 --> 00:13:34.311
 Traveling a prisoner.

184
00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:35.579
                   (LAUGHS)

185
00:13:37.634 --> 00:13:38.633
          You're a woman.

186
00:13:38.701 --> 00:13:39.701
      A woman!

187
00:13:39.769 --> 00:13:41.318
   Well. fuck me!

188
00:13:42.589 --> 00:13:43.688
 If you've quite
 finished up...

189
00:13:43.756 --> 00:13:44.772
      (LAUGHING CONTINUES)

190
00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:48.842
 All right.
 we'll be going.

191
00:13:48.911 --> 00:13:50.144
             Whoa. Whoa!

192
00:13:51.914 --> 00:13:53.064
          Who do you fight for?

193
00:13:54.317 --> 00:13:55.683
 The Starks.

194
00:13:57.353 --> 00:13:58.886
           What did he do?

195
00:14:00.457 --> 00:14:02.457
 Apparently eating is
